OL,3,GNEWSALamborghini driven at twice the
OL,4,Alimit is seized
OL,5,
OL,6,FA luxury Lamborghini has been taken off
OL,7,Fthe road by police after reports it was
OL,8,Fbeing driven at about 80mph (129km/h)
OL,9,Fin a 30mph (48km/h) zone.
OL,11,FEssex Police seized the Huracan in
OL,12,FSouthend-on-Sea after multiple people
OL,13,Fsaid it was being driven dangerously on
OL,14,FSaturday afternoon.
OL,16,FThe Lamborghini Huracan has an
OL,17,Fon-the-road recommended retail price of
OL,18,F#238,195, depending on the version,
OL,19,Faccording to Autotrader.
